	case ACCUMULATE_POINTS
	/// A [loyalty reward](https://developer.squareup.com/reference/square_yyyy-mm-dd/objects/LoyaltyReward) is created.
	case CREATE_REWARD
	/// A loyalty reward is redeemed.
	case REDEEM_REWARD
	/// A loyalty reward is deleted.
	case DELETE_REWARD
	/// Loyalty points are manually adjusted.
	case ADJUST_POINTS
	/// Loyalty points are expired according to the  expiration policy of the loyalty program.
	case EXPIRE_POINTS
	/// Some other loyalty event occurred.
	case OTHER
	///  Points are added to a loyalty account for a purchase that qualified for a [loyalty promotion](https://developer.squareup.com/reference/square_yyyy-mm-dd/objects/LoyaltyPromotion).
	case ACCUMULATE_PROMOTION_POINTS
}

